Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/xenos: sample 1D textures as 2D

A 1D fetch constant hung the GPU (piglit fbo-depth tex1d, copyteximage 1d,
fbo-generatemipmap-1d). Describe 1D textures as 2D textures one texel
high; ir2 already repeats the coordinate.

